osing one's job'.","t":"","parts":[["실","lose"],["직","job"]],"rel":[["실직자","jobless person"],["실업","unemployment"],["취직","getting a job"]],"a":["b013.mp3",1418592,2016,1420608,11424],"nb":["은퇴하다","사직서","해고","실업","알바","정규직","계약직","계약하다"]}],"분석하다":[{"id":"T3-1440","de":"분석하다","rom":"bunseokada","pos":"verb","lv":"T3","pr":"분서카다","forms":"분석해요 · 분석했어요 · 분석할 거예요 · 분석하세요","m":"to analyze","ex":"이 그래프를 분석하면 변화를 쉽게 알 수 있어요.","x":"If you analyze this graph, you can easily see the changes.","e":"Literally 'divide and split apart', plus 하다 'to do'.","t":"Pronounced [분서카다]: ㄱ plus ㅎ becomes ㅋ.","parts":[["분","divide"],["석","split"]],"rel":[["분석","analysis"],["조사하다","to investigate"],["결과","result"]],"a":["b015.mp3",572160,2880,575040,12384],"nb":["결심","판단","비교","분석","평가","인식","동의","찬성"]}],"의심스럽다":[{"id":"T4-1082","de":"의심스럽다","rom":"uisimseureopda","pos":"adjective","lv":"T4","pr":"의심스럽따","forms":"의심스러워요 · 의심스러웠어요 · 의심스러운 (+noun) (ㅂ irregular)","m":"suspicious, doubtful, questionable","ex":"그 사람의 말이 사실인지 의심스러워요.","x":"I doubt whether what that person said is true.","e":"의심 'suspicion' + -스럽다 'seeming' — giving rise to doubt.","t":"","parts":[["의","doubt"],["심","heart"]],"rel":[["의심","suspicion"],["수상하다","suspicious-looking"],["확실하다","certain"]],"a":["b022.mp3",110592,3648,114240,9120],"nb":["반감","거부감","경계심","의심","믿음직하다","믿음직스럽다","기대감","희망적"]}],"열광":[{"id":"T4-1106","de":"열광","rom":"yeolgwang","pos":"noun","lv":"T4","pr":null,"forms":"열광이 · 열광을","m":"wild enthusiasm, frenzy","ex":"그 가수가 무대에 나오자 관객들이 열광했어요.","x":"When the singer came on stage, the audience went wild.","e":"Literally 'hot and wild'.","t":"","parts":[["열","heat"],["광","wild, mad"]],"rel":[["열광하다","to go wild"],["열광적","enthusiastic"],["팬","fan"]],"a":["b022.mp3",474624,2880,477504,14304],"nb":["섭섭함","서운함","억울함","흥분","열정","열정적","열의","의욕"]}],"인색하다":[{"id":"T4-1181","de":"인색하다","rom":"insaekada","pos":"adjective","lv":"T4","pr":"인새카다","forms":"인색해요 · 인색했어요 · 인색한 (+noun)","m":"stingy, miserly; sparing (with praise)","e